Installed-Size: @SIZE_KB@
Homepage: https://github.com/jasontheodorou/video-maker
Description: Turn a short brief into on-brand videos
 Type a short brief in plain English and get back finished, on-brand videos
 with a British voiceover and captions, in landscape, portrait and square.
 .
 Runs in the background all the time and starts by itself when the computer
 starts. Open it from the Video Maker icon. Choose the team password and add
 the Anthropic API key inside the app, and share it with your team from its
 Settings page.
